  "translation": "Yahwe i tok olsem: Yupela i no ken go antap, na yupela i no ken pait wantaim ol brata bilong yupela, ol pikinini bilong Yisrael. Ol i go bek, wanwan man long haus bilong em, bilong dispela tok i kamap ⟨את⟩ long mi. Ol i harim ⟨את⟩ tok bilong Yahwe, na ol i go bek bilong wokabaut, olsem tok bilong Yahwe.",
